Karate selama tujuh tahun.

486
00:36:05,583 --> 00:36:07,082
Jangan khawatir.

487
00:36:07,083 --> 00:36:09,216
Kemarilah! / Tidak!

488
00:36:09,375 --> 00:36:11,925
Aku akan sediam hyena.

489
00:36:16,333 --> 00:36:18,957
