Ayo!

491
00:36:20,333 --> 00:36:21,582
Semuanya!

492
00:36:21,583 --> 00:36:23,925
Naiklah!

493
00:36:24,166 --> 00:36:27,040
Semangat, ayo!

494
00:36:27,041 --> 00:36:28,758
Lakuken!

495
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:31,175
Awas kalo gagal!

496
00:36:31,250 --> 00:36:33,341
Yang cepat!

497
